    "short_description": "Snow Ash is a post-apocalyptic, wasteland-themed card-based trading and survival game. In this snow-covered world, you\u2019ll take on the role of a messenger, braving blizzards to deliver goods between scattered shelters. In the biting cold and swirling snow, where will your journey lead?",
